# Tap gamepad buttons 0 through 7 in turn.
device gamepad
connect
pad button 0 down
pad button 0 up
pad button 1 down
pad button 1 up
pad button 2 down
pad button 2 up
pad button 3 down
pad button 3 up
pad button 4 down
pad button 4 up
pad button 5 down
pad button 5 up
pad button 6 down
pad button 6 up
pad button 7 down
pad button 7 up
